# 统一换行与二进制判定，避免 Windows/Linux 互相改一大片
* text=auto eol=lf

# Unity 文本资源（可以走 Smart Merge）
*.unity text
*.prefab text
*.asset text
*.mat text
*.anim text
*.controller text
*.meta text
*.cs text
*.md text
*.json text
*.txt text

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
